<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Fralex yr shr rises, sees growth in 1997.</title>
<headline>Fralex yr shr rises, sees growth in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30, 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     34.9	  vs 29.8</p>
<p>    Total div (cts)	 11.5	  vs 9.8</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   26.30	 vs 23.00</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   53.25	 vs 52.59</p>
<p>    Tax			 7.80	  vs 13.48</p>
<p>    Turnover		  513.58	vs 416.92</p>
<p>Div payable October 25</p>
<p>on register October 11</p>
<p>Full name: Fralex Ltd</p>
<p>    Exceptional items     13.17 gain  vs 14.83 gain</p>
<p>NOTE - Industrial and engineering holding firm Fralex Ltd said its major businesses are soundly positioned to produce growth at or above the past year's levels and the firm expected to post an increase in earnings in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
